# GitHub Actions variables (Repository → Settings → Variables)

| Variable | Example | Used by |
|----------|---------|---------|
| `VITE_API_URL` | `https://api.lead-cat.space` | admin, mini-app Docker builds |
| `VITE_BOT_USERNAME` | `lead_cat_bot` | mini-app, landing |
| `VITE_SITE_URL` | `https://lead-cat.space` | landing |
| `VITE_ADMIN_URL` | `https://admin.lead-cat.space` | landing |

Do not set `VITE_TMA_DEV_TG_ID` for production mini-app builds.
